WEBVTT

00:01:29.495 --> 00:01:31.195
and that emergent sine curve of fire.

00:01:31.195 --> 00:01:32.773
So let's turn that off. We're indoors.

00:01:32.773 --> 00:01:38.364
Thank you. (Applause)

00:01:38.364 --> 00:01:40.711
I also have with me a flame table.

