00:01:44.397 --> 00:01:46.365
such as eigenmodes, so let's fire it up

00:01:46.365 --> 00:01:48.615
and see what it does.

00:01:52.292 --> 00:01:56.760
Ooh. (Laughter)

00:01:56.760 --> 00:01:59.734
Okay. Now, while the table comes up to pressure,

00:01:59.734 --> 00:02:01.406
let me note here that the sound is not traveling